Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:09.25,0:00:12.30,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天的卡拉OK超嗨對吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:12.55,0:00:14.43,Default,,0,0,0,,瀏海弄不順
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:14.76,0:00:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,三年級吉田學姐的男友
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:16.76,0:00:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,聽說超級帥喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:18.68,0:00:21.02,Default,,0,0,0,,真假？好羨慕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:35.20,0:00:37.95,Default,,0,0,0,,瀨尾拓也 高一
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:38.78,0:00:40.29,Default,,0,0,0,,就是所謂的阿宅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:40.45,0:00:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,但可不是普通的動畫宅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:43.00,0:00:44.16,Default,,0,0,0,,不瞞各位…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:45.50,0:00:48.13,Default,,0,0,0,,是個最喜歡女童向動畫的阿宅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:49.79,0:00:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,應募限定的閃萌橡皮擦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:51.92,0:00:53.51,Default,,0,0,0,,終於入手了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:56.05,0:00:57.05,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（閃亮萌寵）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:57.18,0:00:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,所謂的閃萌
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:00.06,0:01:02.56,Default,,0,0,0,,是每週日早上10點播出的\n女童向動畫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:02.72,0:01:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,閃亮萌寵
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:04.60,0:01:06.60,Default,,0,0,0,,與可愛的角色和世界觀相反的是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:06.73,0:01:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,因為劇情莫名其妙地黑暗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:08.56,0:01:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,被稱為"深夜34時動畫"
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:11.27,0:01:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,異常沉重的設定
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:12.53,0:01:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,和隨處安插的神祕超現實笑話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:14.69,0:01:17.07,Default,,0,0,0,,緊緊抓住了部分粉絲的心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:17.28,0:01:19.32,Default,,0,0,0,,前期動畫雖然獲得了爆發性的人氣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:19.41,0:01:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,-但這期不太受矚目\n-糟糕 忘了帶橡皮擦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:21.41,0:01:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,-但我覺得這是至今系列作最棒的一季\n-跟阿宅借好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:25.00,0:01:27.42,Default,,0,0,0,,欸欸 阿宅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:27.75,0:01:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,橡皮擦借我一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:30.21,0:01:32.17,Default,,0,0,0,,等 等一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:32.30,0:01:33.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我會還你的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:34.01,0:01:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,不 但 但是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:35.22,0:01:36.51,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:36.59,0:01:38.51,Default,,0,0,0,,那… 那個… 有點…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:38.68,0:01:41.76,Default,,0,0,0,,欸 為什麼 借一下又沒關係
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:42.01,0:01:42.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那… 那是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:44.52,0:01:47.64,Default,,0,0,0,,那是很重要的… 東西…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:48.19,0:01:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,重要？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:50.98,0:01:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,這我知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:52.32,0:01:53.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是那個妖可夢對吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:53.65,0:01:55.32,Default,,0,0,0,,不… 不是 是閃萌
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:55.53,0:01:56.82,Default,,0,0,0,,閃亮萌寵
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:57.03,0:01:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,是喔？都長得很像
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:59.41,0:02:01.91,Default,,0,0,0,,沒聽過耶 很有名嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:02.83,0:02:05.33,Default,,0,0,0,,坐前面的伊地知琴子同學
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:05.75,0:02:08.08,Default,,0,0,0,,隨和愛熱鬧 是典型辣妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:10.04,0:02:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,我不擅長應付
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:11.92,0:02:14.17,Default,,0,0,0,,經常待在一起的天音慶同學
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:14.92,0:02:17.05,Default,,0,0,0,,像模特兒一樣的高冷辣妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:18.80,0:02:20.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我不擅長應付
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:21.59,0:02:24.10,Default,,0,0,0,,對阿宅溫柔的辣妹根本不存在
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:24.68,0:02:27.10,Default,,0,0,0,,天音 妳看這個 是波卡丘
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:27.23,0:02:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,不對 那是凱比
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:28.64,0:02:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,主角的搭檔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:29.81,0:02:32.44,Default,,0,0,0,,第四話首次登場\n用綠寶石戰鬥的閃萌
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:34.11,0:02:36.44,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅在說什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:36.65,0:02:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,真的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:39.03,0:02:40.61,Default,,0,0,0,,初登場明明是第二話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:43.99,0:02:46.37,Default,,0,0,0,,欸？剛才… 欸？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:46.54,0:02:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,那這個呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:48.00,0:02:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,這也是閃萌嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:49.71,0:02:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:51.21,0:02:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,那是叫凸目獸的閃萌
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:53.88,0:02:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,按一下屁股 眼球會…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:55.63,0:02:56.63,Default,,0,0,0,,噴出來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:58.34,0:02:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,好好笑
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:59.42,0:03:01.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我也開始有點興趣了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:01.93,0:03:03.35,Default,,0,0,0,,閃萌是什麼樣的故事？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:06.14,0:03:07.27,Default,,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:07.35,0:03:09.73,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅最渴望被問到的問題
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:10.31,0:03:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,不執著於推的角色…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:11.94,0:03:13.36,Default,,0,0,0,,連劇情都想知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:13.61,0:03:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,對渴望傾訴的阿宅來說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:15.73,0:03:17.48,Default,,0,0,0,,這提議簡直就是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:18.11,0:03:19.49,Default,,0,0,0,,僥倖…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:20.86,0:03:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,純真無邪的神助攻
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:22.20,0:03:23.99,Default,,0,0,0,,可怕的伊地知同學
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:24.45,0:03:25.33,Default,,0,0,0,,可是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:25.66,0:03:26.87,Default,,0,0,0,,這是陷阱
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:27.08,0:03:29.33,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅滔滔不絕地講著\n人家沒興趣的話題
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:29.45,0:03:31.08,Default,,0,0,0,,不管怎麼想都超噁
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:32.42,0:03:34.25,Default,,0,0,0,,好想聊卻不能聊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:35.59,0:03:37.13,Default,,0,0,0,,天… 天音同學
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:38.05,0:03:39.46,Default,,0,0,0,,天音怎麼了？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:39.59,0:03:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我說了什麼奇怪的話嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:45.26,0:03:47.56,Default,,0,0,0,,我交到了好朋友…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:49.18,0:03:50.10,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼意思？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:50.43,0:03:52.19,Default,,0,0,0,,直接看比較快
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:52.39,0:03:54.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我明天把漫畫版帶過來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:54.23,0:03:55.94,Default,,0,0,0,,欸 天音妳很懂嘛？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:56.15,0:03:57.27,Default,,0,0,0,,可愛的角色很多
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:57.40,0:03:58.48,Default,,0,0,0,,妳說不定也會入坑
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:58.73,0:04:00.53,Default,,0,0,0,,是哦 謝啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:00.94,0:04:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,也？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:02.61,0:04:04.11,Default,,0,0,0,,我… 我妹啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:04.36,0:04:07.03,Default,,0,0,0,,因為我妹最近很迷這個
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:07.12,0:04:08.83,Default,,0,0,0,,這樣啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:16.08,0:04:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,真的耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:18.55,0:04:21.51,Default,,0,0,0,,凱比真的有在第二話登場
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:23.63,0:04:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同學…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:25.68,0:04:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,難道說…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:29.51,0:04:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,連我都沒注意到凱比初登場的畫面
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:33.85,0:04:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,如果沒興趣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:35.10,0:04:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,絕對不可能知道的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:38.15,0:04:41.61,Default,,0,0,0,,但那可是冷門的女童向動畫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:42.28,0:04:44.36,Default,,0,0,0,,實在令人不敢置信
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:45.41,0:04:48.49,Default,,0,0,0,,班上處於現充頂點的天音同學…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:51.20,0:04:54.21,Default,,0,0,0,,竟然會…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:57.25,0:04:58.54,Default,,0,0,0,,天音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:58.63,0:05:00.42,Default,,0,0,0,,放學要不要去卡拉OK？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:00.59,0:05:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,抱歉 今天Pass
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:03.26,0:05:04.55,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:04.67,0:05:06.43,Default,,0,0,0,,我有想跟妳對唱的歌耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:07.14,0:05:08.43,Default,,0,0,0,,-好想聊聊看…\n-下次吧 我先走囉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:09.26,0:05:12.68,Default,,0,0,0,,身為阿宅的我竟然得找辣妹搭話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:15.39,0:05:16.35,Default,,0,0,0,,不
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:16.77,0:05:20.57,Default,,0,0,0,,即使如此 她說不定是第一個\n能聊閃萌的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:25.28,0:05:27.24,Default,,0,0,0,,那… 那個
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:27.53,0:05:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,等… 等一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:29.03,0:05:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,天… 天音同學
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:30.49,0:05:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,別誤會
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:31.99,0:05:32.95,Default,,0,0,0,,不是那樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:33.12,0:05:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,好… 好近
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:34.70,0:05:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,閃萌… 是我妹…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:37.37,0:05:39.21,Default,,0,0,0,,只是我妹常看罷了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:39.50,0:05:41.63,Default,,0,0,0,,並不是我自己喜歡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:41.80,0:05:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,這… 這樣啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:44.26,0:05:45.17,Default,,0,0,0,,對
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:47.72,0:05:49.64,Default,,0,0,0,,對不起 我擅自誤會了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:50.05,0:05:52.01,Default,,0,0,0,,妳對這種東西沒興趣吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:52.39,0:05:54.31,Default,,0,0,0,,限定鑰匙圈什麼的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:56.89,0:05:57.85,Default,,0,0,0,,不會吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:58.02,0:06:00.73,Default,,0,0,0,,這是漫畫版第一集初回特典異色版
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:00.86,0:06:02.07,Default,,0,0,0,,好羨慕喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:02.32,0:06:04.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我跑了三家 結果買到的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:04.48,0:06:06.82,Default,,0,0,0,,三個都是普通顏色的說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:07.53,0:06:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我… 我妹啦 我妹在家一直抱怨…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:11.49,0:06:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,要… 要拿出來看看嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:13.62,0:06:14.83,Default,,0,0,0,,可以嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:14.95,0:06:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:17.04,0:06:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 好可愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:19.37,0:06:21.42,Default,,0,0,0,,話說選粉紅色的人根本天才吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:21.63,0:06:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,一般都是黑色的 這種反差萌…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:23.46,0:06:25.21,Default,,0,0,0,,那個 不嫌棄就送妳吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:25.42,0:06:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,因為我有兩個…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:28.13,0:06:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,可以嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:34.85,0:06:37.02,Default,,0,0,0,,謝啦 我妹一定會很高興
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:37.23,0:06:38.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:38.56,0:06:40.81,Default,,0,0,0,,太… 太可愛了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:42.65,0:06:43.61,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（哪裡有溫柔對待阿宅的辣妹？）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:43.73,0:06:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅辣妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:54.37,0:06:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,早
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:56.12,0:06:57.66,Default,,0,0,0,,大家有精神嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:57.95,0:07:01.17,Default,,0,0,0,,今天一天也要加油喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:01.29,0:07:02.96,Default,,0,0,0,,早 伊地知
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:05.55,0:07:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,早喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:06.96,0:07:09.72,Default,,0,0,0,,棒球社 晨練辛苦囉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:10.13,0:07:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,真弓 早
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:12.68,0:07:14.55,Default,,0,0,0,,好好 伊地知早
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:20.73,0:07:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,唉唷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:22.48,0:07:24.61,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知UFO把阿宅的橡皮擦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:24.73,0:07:26.23,Default,,0,0,0,,吸走啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:28.86,0:07:31.61,Default,,0,0,0,,若… 若是忘了帶請直說…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:31.70,0:07:33.11,Default,,0,0,0,,穿幫了？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:33.74,0:07:38.08,Default,,0,0,0,,自從上次換座位坐到我前面後
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:38.66,0:07:41.12,Default,,0,0,0,,她也會正常地向我這種阿宅搭話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:41.21,0:07:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然很高興
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:42.67,0:07:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-但這距離感實在…\n-奇怪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:45.25,0:07:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,這跟之前的不一樣吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:47.09,0:07:48.09,Default,,0,0,0,,是救援松鼠耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:49.05,0:07:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,妳… 妳看了閃萌嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:51.47,0:07:53.18,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然才看一點點
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:53.34,0:07:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,天音借了我漫畫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:55.72,0:07:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,漫畫版！很棒對吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:58.64,0:08:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,一般動畫原作改編漫畫\n風格容易有落差
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:00.60,0:08:01.98,Default,,0,0,0,,但這部完美地融合進去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:02.10,0:08:02.89,Default,,0,0,0,,忠於原作的同時
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:02.98,0:08:05.61,Default,,0,0,0,,又深入挖掘動畫因時長\n而省略的部分
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:05.90,0:08:09.03,Default,,0,0,0,,角色之間的關係更容易傳達給讀者
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:10.15,0:08:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,對… 對不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:12.40,0:08:14.53,Default,,0,0,0,,我… 我搞砸了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:14.61,0:08:16.62,Default,,0,0,0,,我剛才那樣絕對超噁
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:16.78,0:08:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,慢慢講沒關係喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:19.62,0:08:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我有在聽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:22.46,0:08:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知同學…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:23.67,0:08:24.54,Default,,0,0,0,,咦？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:24.62,0:08:26.67,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅跟火箭人很像耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:26.96,0:08:28.71,Default,,0,0,0,,火箭人？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:30.59,0:08:31.80,Default,,0,0,0,,火箭人是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:32.05,0:08:34.30,Default,,0,0,0,,那個主角的朋友小圓的搭檔？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:34.55,0:08:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,對對
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:36.51,0:08:38.18,Default,,0,0,0,,火箭人會帶領軟弱的小圓前進
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:38.30,0:08:40.60,Default,,0,0,0,,是值得信賴的閃萌
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:41.14,0:08:43.18,Default,,0,0,0,,我跟他並沒有共同點…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:47.48,0:08:50.65,Default,,0,0,0,,看你這意外圓滾滾的大眼睛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:00.79,0:09:02.95,Default,,0,0,0,,還有動不動就臉紅的模樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:04.21,0:09:05.67,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（哪裡有溫柔對待阿宅的辣妹？）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:06.21,0:09:07.25,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（在有玻璃做日光浴的公園散步）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:07.67,0:09:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:09.04,0:09:10.25,Default,,0,0,0,,你有在玩Mins嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:10.42,0:09:12.26,Default,,0,0,0,,欸 為‥為什麼問這個？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:12.38,0:09:14.01,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有啊 隨口問問
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:14.59,0:09:15.88,Default,,0,0,0,,我是有帳號
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:16.18,0:09:18.09,Default,,0,0,0,,但內容不能隨便給人看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:18.26,0:09:20.35,Default,,0,0,0,,這不是有發文嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:20.68,0:09:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,這些全部都是閃萌？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:24.23,0:09:26.85,Default,,0,0,0,,瀨尾的帳號都是動畫什麼的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:27.06,0:09:28.15,Default,,0,0,0,,太陰沉了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:28.23,0:09:29.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:29.44,0:09:30.36,Default,,0,0,0,,噁
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:33.99,0:09:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,完了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:35.24,0:09:37.61,Default,,0,0,0,,又要回到被當噁男欺負的日子了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:37.70,0:09:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,欸 這真的超厲害耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:40.08,0:09:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,這張圖是你畫的嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:42.66,0:09:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,畫超好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:45.66,0:09:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,不覺得噁心嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:47.50,0:09:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼？很厲害啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:49.96,0:09:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,能收集這麼多東西
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:51.71,0:09:52.96,Default,,0,0,0,,對一件事這麼入迷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:53.25,0:09:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我超尊敬的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:55.80,0:09:57.22,Default,,0,0,0,,沒被嫌棄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:57.63,0:09:59.05,Default,,0,0,0,,但果然…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:59.18,0:10:01.64,Default,,0,0,0,,都是物品照片 看起來有點寂寞耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:01.85,0:10:03.06,Default,,0,0,0,,是… 是嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:07.81,0:10:08.73,Default,,0,0,0,,好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:09.31,0:10:10.40,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知同學
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:11.77,0:10:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,妳‥ 妳做什麼？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:16.32,0:10:18.32,Default,,0,0,0,,偶爾來一下這種的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:18.53,0:10:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,也不錯吧？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:23.66,0:10:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,對阿宅溫柔的辣妹什麼的…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:37.76,0:10:40.76,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天的閃萌 帕契消失了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:41.43,0:10:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,帕契是敵方的閃萌
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:43.89,0:10:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,平時雖然愛酸人又討厭
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:46.98,0:10:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但他理解幸子的本質
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:48.94,0:10:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,偶爾會給出切中要點的建言\n是神祕的角色
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:52.11,0:10:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（帕契：再見了）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:53.15,0:10:55.65,Default,,0,0,0,,那個伏筆終於回收了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:56.53,0:10:57.90,Default,,0,0,0,,為了守護幸子…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:58.70,0:10:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,他死了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:00.16,0:11:01.36,Default,,0,0,0,,帕契…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:02.24,0:11:04.62,Default,,0,0,0,,為什麼…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:05.33,0:11:07.83,Default,,0,0,0,,這份悲傷 這股衝動
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:07.91,0:11:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,好想跟誰分享
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:09.71,0:11:12.46,Default,,0,0,0,,但閃萌是冷門女童向動畫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:12.79,0:11:15.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我身邊在看的人…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:19.92,0:11:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同學
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:25.10,0:11:26.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那個表情…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:27.72,0:11:28.98,Default,,0,0,0,,眼睛紅紅的…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:31.98,0:11:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,超大一聲嘆息
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:33.31,0:11:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,絕對沒錯 那是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:35.82,0:11:37.11,Default,,0,0,0,,為帕契流的淚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:37.57,0:11:41.07,Default,,0,0,0,,欸 不覺得今天的天音\n比平常更色氣嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:41.45,0:11:42.41,Default,,0,0,0,,戀愛了？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:43.45,0:11:46.41,Default,,0,0,0,,-是 是啊 哭的理由有很多\n-感覺像談了戲劇性的戀愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:46.70,0:11:48.95,Default,,0,0,0,,尤其是像天音同學這種人…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:49.45,0:11:50.41,Default,,0,0,0,,可惡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:50.75,0:11:51.71,Default,,0,0,0,,怎麼了？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:51.83,0:11:53.67,Default,,0,0,0,,又因為Bug動不了了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:54.08,0:11:56.46,Default,,0,0,0,,修正補丁趕快出來啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:56.59,0:11:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,帕契？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:00.22,0:12:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,抱 抱歉…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:02.18,0:12:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同學也在玩這遊戲嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:04.05,0:12:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,要不要加好友？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:05.35,0:12:06.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我有想要的東西
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:06.76,0:12:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,遊… 遊戲？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:07.93,0:12:09.93,Default,,0,0,0,,是說那個啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:10.39,0:12:12.77,Default,,0,0,0,,那果然是為帕契流的淚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:13.77,0:12:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,天音同學…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:15.48,0:12:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,應該是阿宅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:19.36,0:12:20.15,Default,,0,0,0,,天音…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:21.03,0:12:21.95,Default,,0,0,0,,請跟我…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:22.90,0:12:23.95,Default,,0,0,0,,交往吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:29.66,0:12:31.33,Default,,0,0,0,,好猛 臉紅心跳了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:35.46,0:12:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我聽說囉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:36.96,0:12:39.38,Default,,0,0,0,,男籃隊長跟妳告白了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:39.46,0:12:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,而且妳還拒絕了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:41.09,0:12:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,因為我跟他又不熟
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:44.09,0:12:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,真的很受歡迎耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:45.72,0:12:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,這是第幾人了？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:46.72,0:12:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,-那個華麗又受歡迎的天音同學\n-因為天音是大美女嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:49.56,0:12:51.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-果然是我的錯覺吧\n-皮膚超漂亮的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:52.02,0:12:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,平常有在買保養品嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:53.64,0:12:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有 就防曬乳而已吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:55.94,0:12:56.90,Default,,0,0,0,,真的假的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:56.98,0:12:59.15,Default,,0,0,0,,那妳錢都花在哪？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:59.98,0:13:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,就是閃…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:01.53,0:13:02.94,Default,,0,0,0,,閃亮飾品之類的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:03.78,0:13:06.74,Default,,0,0,0,,剛才是不是\n差點說出閃萌周邊？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:07.41,0:13:08.28,Default,,0,0,0,,有點意外耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:08.41,0:13:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,-不… 什麼都往那邊想也太…\n-飾品啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:11.24,0:13:13.46,Default,,0,0,0,,包包上的飾品也很可愛耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:13.62,0:13:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,飾品？是… 是嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:15.96,0:13:16.96,Default,,0,0,0,,謝謝
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:20.00,0:13:21.09,Default,,0,0,0,,那… 那是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:21.80,0:13:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,幸子的魔法杖胸針
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:25.72,0:13:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,那是飾品店與閃萌聯名的限定品
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:29.80,0:13:31.81,Default,,0,0,0,,但因為太過女童向…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:33.73,0:13:35.56,Default,,0,0,0,,好 好難買…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:36.85,0:13:38.15,Default,,0,0,0,,好羨慕啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:38.52,0:13:41.32,Default,,0,0,0,,連那種稀有品都入手了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:41.61,0:13:44.07,Default,,0,0,0,,確定了 天音同學果然是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:44.15,0:13:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:45.95,0:13:47.53,Default,,0,0,0,,妳… 妳在說什麼…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:47.70,0:13:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你看到我包包上的那個了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:50.16,0:13:52.79,Default,,0,0,0,,那不是我主動想買的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:52.95,0:13:55.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是我妹吵著要買成對的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:55.25,0:13:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,所以我絕對不是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:56.33,0:13:57.29,Default,,0,0,0,,那… 那個
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:58.79,0:14:00.79,Default,,0,0,0,,昨天帕契死了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:01.96,0:14:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我… 我哭了一晚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:04.63,0:14:07.59,Default,,0,0,0,,天… 天音同學會討厭嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:08.13,0:14:09.51,Default,,0,0,0,,閃萌的東西
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:09.72,0:14:11.72,Default,,0,0,0,,那當然是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:13.06,0:14:14.02,Default,,0,0,0,,很喜歡啊…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:15.60,0:14:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,不對 是因為妹妹喜歡\n所以我被傳染啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:18.94,0:14:20.56,Default,,0,0,0,,你別誤會
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:22.15,0:14:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你們在交往？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:23.36,0:14:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:24.57,0:14:26.44,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 妳從哪裡開始聽的？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:26.90,0:14:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,什麼喜歡啊別誤會的…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:29.45,0:14:31.95,Default,,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:32.08,0:14:34.08,Default,,0,0,0,,是在說那個飾品…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:34.24,0:14:35.83,Default,,0,0,0,,對吧？阿宅…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:36.41,0:14:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:42.09,0:14:43.00,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅辣妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:47.22,0:14:48.51,Default,,0,0,0,,咦… 沒有…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:49.13,0:14:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,沒有 沒有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:51.30,0:14:53.68,Default,,0,0,0,,忘記帶課本了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:54.56,0:14:55.97,Default,,0,0,0,,翻到第56頁
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:56.06,0:15:00.31,Default,,0,0,0,,偏偏是\n全校最恐怖的老師的課
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:00.40,0:15:01.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（英文教師（36歲）\n游泳部顧問 綽號黑手黨）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:01.60,0:15:03.57,Default,,0,0,0,,-桌上不能空空的\n-今天接著上昨天教完的過去完成式
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:03.90,0:15:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,-總之先\n-期中考也必考這段
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:05.90,0:15:08.49,Default,,0,0,0,,-用數學課本充當一下\n-這是重要文法 要重點複習
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:08.65,0:15:10.03,Default,,0,0,0,,-想辦法…\n-把課本的例句…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:10.11,0:15:11.11,Default,,0,0,0,,撐過去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:11.20,0:15:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,從小林開始按座號朗讀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:13.28,0:15:14.41,Default,,0,0,0,,是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:17.41,0:15:19.50,Default,,0,0,0,,座號？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:20.58,0:15:22.29,Default,,0,0,0,,小林 齋藤
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:22.46,0:15:23.84,Default,,0,0,0,,白川 須藤
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:24.25,0:15:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不會吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:40.73,0:15:42.94,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅借我紅筆
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:47.69,0:15:49.03,Default,,0,0,0,,被發現了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:49.69,0:15:53.91,Default,,0,0,0,,大家快看 阿宅拿數學課本在裝\n太扯了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:55.33,0:15:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,要是被拆穿\n就算伊地知同學沒惡意
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:58.62,0:15:59.95,Default,,0,0,0,,我也會被全班嘲笑…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:00.21,0:16:02.71,Default,,0,0,0,,老師 我忘了帶課本
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:04.13,0:16:06.21,Default,,0,0,0,,真是 伊地知妳又忘了？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:06.42,0:16:08.25,Default,,0,0,0,,受不了 找人一起看吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:08.38,0:16:10.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我旁邊是空位喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:10.22,0:16:11.47,Default,,0,0,0,,沒關係
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:11.63,0:16:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我看瀨尾同學的就好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:15.85,0:16:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,拿數學課本裝死太好笑了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:19.39,0:16:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,輪到你朗讀時 你打算怎麼辦？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:22.77,0:16:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,課本…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:24.15,0:16:25.48,Default,,0,0,0,,妳是為了幫我？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:27.23,0:16:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,因為你平常都會借我文具
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:31.40,0:16:33.53,Default,,0,0,0,,這是回禮喔…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:37.12,0:16:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,所以借我紅筆
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:39.20,0:16:41.71,Default,,0,0,0,,瀨尾 伊地知 看前面
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:43.00,0:16:43.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（（哪裡有溫柔對待阿宅的辣妹？）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:44.00,0:16:45.00,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅辣妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:49.38,0:16:50.67,Default,,0,0,0,,要去社團嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:50.80,0:16:51.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好懶喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:52.05,0:16:54.01,Default,,0,0,0,,欸 今天去唱卡拉OK啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:54.18,0:16:56.09,Default,,0,0,0,,妳昨天不是才去過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:56.22,0:16:58.56,Default,,0,0,0,,天音呢？只要開心 每天去也行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:58.81,0:17:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,每天去還是會膩吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:02.10,0:17:04.52,Default,,0,0,0,,那兩人真的很可愛耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:04.64,0:17:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,對啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:06.15,0:17:08.52,Default,,0,0,0,,聽說天音同學以前當過模特兒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:08.61,0:17:09.48,Default,,0,0,0,,真的嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:09.65,0:17:11.65,Default,,0,0,0,,琴子也跟偶像一樣可愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:12.03,0:17:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知很好聊呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:13.99,0:17:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,確實
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:14.99,0:17:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,我倒是有點想被天音同學罵
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:22.25,0:17:23.58,Default,,0,0,0,,理所當然地
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:24.00,0:17:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,再次感受到她們跟我這種陰角宅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:27.00,0:17:30.00,Default,,0,0,0,,是不同世界的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:30.63,0:17:31.63,Default,,0,0,0,,算了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:31.88,0:17:33.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我還有那個
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:33.51,0:17:36.63,Default,,0,0,0,,今天發售的閃萌盲盒模型
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:37.59,0:17:39.93,Default,,0,0,0,,每人限購一盒的稀有周邊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:40.14,0:17:42.39,Default,,0,0,0,,無論如何一定要拿到手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:51.61,0:17:52.94,Default,,0,0,0,,小哥
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:53.57,0:17:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,是… 是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:55.03,0:17:57.53,Default,,0,0,0,,區公所在哪？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:57.70,0:17:59.16,Default,,0,0,0,,區公所啦！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:00.70,0:18:03.16,Default,,0,0,0,,完全搞不清楚在哪裡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:03.33,0:18:05.62,Default,,0,0,0,,手… 手機呢？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:06.54,0:18:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,手機…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:08.88,0:18:10.75,Default,,0,0,0,,我不會用
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:16.38,0:18:19.14,Default,,0,0,0,,花了不少時間
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:19.72,0:18:21.30,Default,,0,0,0,,總算到了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:22.01,0:18:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:23.26,0:18:24.56,Default,,0,0,0,,沒什麼人在排隊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:24.85,0:18:27.44,Default,,0,0,0,,感覺沒什麼人氣 心情有點複雜
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:28.35,0:18:30.40,Default,,0,0,0,,好期待啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:30.61,0:18:32.36,Default,,0,0,0,,好 我要買了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:35.74,0:18:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,不是的！這個是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:38.11,0:18:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我… 我妹
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:39.41,0:18:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,因為我妹非常期待
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:41.37,0:18:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,我才代替她來買…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:42.78,0:18:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,這不是阿宅嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:44.33,0:18:47.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不愧是阿宅 會在這種地方見面
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:47.08,0:18:48.29,Default,,0,0,0,,是… 是的…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:50.75,0:18:52.25,Default,,0,0,0,,閃萌模型…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:53.00,0:18:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,那是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:54.25,0:18:56.97,Default,,0,0,0,,話說妳們不是要去唱卡拉OK嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:57.13,0:18:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,那個喔…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:58.76,0:19:01.43,Default,,0,0,0,,男生多到感覺像聯誼 我們就跑了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:01.68,0:19:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,而且今天…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:03.18,0:19:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,有賣這個
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:04.35,0:19:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我覺得
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:05.60,0:19:07.31,Default,,0,0,0,,跟著笑咪咪跑出來的天音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:07.43,0:19:09.85,Default,,0,0,0,,好像比較好玩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:10.15,0:19:11.35,Default,,0,0,0,,原來是這樣…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:13.15,0:19:15.65,Default,,0,0,0,,果然天音同學也喜歡閃萌
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:17.36,0:19:20.66,Default,,0,0,0,,好… 好想問她要不要一起買
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:21.11,0:19:22.03,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（閃萌盲盒模型）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:22.12,0:19:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,一起買的話抽到目標的機率\n也會提高
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:25.83,0:19:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-重點是感覺會很開心\n-說起來 很少看到天音這麼開心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:29.58,0:19:32.04,Default,,0,0,0,,也… 也沒有那麼開心啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:32.33,0:19:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,話說阿拓都哭了喔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:34.75,0:19:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,說天音竟然沒來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:37.26,0:19:40.01,Default,,0,0,0,,那個人太積極了 我不擅長應付
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:40.30,0:19:41.34,Default,,0,0,0,,哎呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:41.68,0:19:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,是不同世界的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:44.72,0:19:46.64,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅與辣妹無法相容
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:47.10,0:19:49.31,Default,,0,0,0,,待會再偷偷跑回來買吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:58.28,0:20:00.49,Default,,0,0,0,,阿宅啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:01.32,0:20:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你要買模型對吧？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:03.03,0:20:04.78,Default,,0,0,0,,一起買嘛！
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:06.74,0:20:09.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我也買一個幫天音抽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:09.41,0:20:12.04,Default,,0,0,0,,抽到吸血鬼大帝的話\n可以跟我換嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:12.17,0:20:13.71,Default,,0,0,0,,是我… 我妹最推的角色…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:13.83,0:20:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,快點快點 要選囉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:15.54,0:20:17.21,Default,,0,0,0,,好…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:27.39,0:20:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,來了！是我想要的露娜小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:30.85,0:20:31.77,Default,,0,0,0,,太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:31.85,0:20:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,恭喜
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:37.57,0:20:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（葵葉區公所）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:44.86,0:20:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,難道是助人的回報嗎？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:47.28,0:20:51.00,Default,,0,0,0,,好啦！會抽到什麼呢？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:51.12,0:20:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,伊地知同學 那是隱藏版耶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:54.37,0:20:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,是喔？太好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:00.30,0:21:01.46,Default,,0,0,0,,吸血鬼大人…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:02.01,0:21:03.30,Default,,0,0,0,,沒抽到…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:04.76,0:21:08.05,Default,,0,0,0,,雖然也很喜歡帕契…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:11.43,0:21:13.77,Default,,0,0,0,,對阿宅溫柔的辣妹…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:17.52,0:21:19.19,Default,,0,0,0,,說不定真的存在
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:19.65,0:21:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}（第一節課 阿宅 辣妹與閃萌）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:53.83,0:22:56.25,Default,,0,0,0,,怎… 怎麼會變成這樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:56.79,0:22:57.91,Default,,0,0,0,,哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:58.04,0:23:00.08,Default,,0,0,0,,沒想到很乾淨嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:00.29,0:23:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,彩圖在哪裡？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:02.63,0:23:05.46,Default,,0,0,0,,最強辣妹二人組竟然來到我房間
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:05.63,0:23:07.67,Default,,0,0,0,,我該怎麼辦？
